    "objectID": "snippets/tsd.html",
    "href": "snippets/tsd.html",
    "title": "6  Time series with data (Tsd)",
    "section": "",
    "text": "import pynapple as nap\nimport numpy as np\ntimes = np.arange(0, 10, 0.01)\nsignal = np.sin(2 * np.pi * times) \nsignal += 0.2 * np.random.randn(len(times))\ntsd = nap.Tsd(t=times, d=signal)\nsmoothed = tsd.smooth(std=0.1)\nsmoothed\n\nTime (s)\n-----------------  ---------\n0.0                 0.161698\n0.01                0.184316\n0.02                0.208609\n0.03                0.234484\n0.04                0.261822\n0.05                0.290471\n0.06                0.320256\n...\n9.93               -0.458474\n9.94               -0.424205\n9.950000000000001  -0.390357\n9.96               -0.357192\n9.97               -0.324953\n9.98               -0.293865\n9.99               -0.264127\ndtype: float64, shape: (1000,)",
    "crumbs": [
      "Pynapple fundamentals",
      "<span class='chapter-number'>6</span>  <span class='chapter-title'>Time series with data (`Tsd`)</span>"
    ]
  },
  {
    "objectID": "snippets/tsdframe.html",
