    "section": "",
    "text": "import pynapple as nap\ntsdframe = nap.TsdFrame(\n    t=[1,2,3,4,5], \n    d=[[1,2],\n       [1,2],\n       [1,3],\n       [2,1],\n       [1,2]],\n    columns=[\"A\", \"B\"]\n)\ntsdframe\n\nTime (s)      A    B\n----------  ---  ---\n1             1    2\n2             1    2\n3             1    3\n4             2    1\n5             1    2\ndtype: int64, shape: (5, 2)",
    "crumbs": [
