    "title": "11  Taking values (value_from)",
    "section": "",
    "text": "import pynapple as nap\nimport numpy as np\nts = nap.Ts(t=[1,2,3,4,5])\ntsd = nap.Tsd(t=np.arange(0, 10, 0.1), d=np.random.randn(100))\nvalues = ts.value_from(tsd)\nvalues\n\nTime (s)\n----------  ---------\n1           -0.350505\n2           -0.206685\n3           -0.966595\n4            0.927325\n5           -0.204304\ndtype: float64, shape: (5,)",
    "crumbs": [
