    "section": "",
    "text": "import pynapple as nap\nimport numpy as np\ntsdframe = nap.TsdFrame(\n    t=[1,2,3,4,5], \n    d=[[1,2],\n       [1,2],\n       [1,3],\n       [2,1],\n       [1,2]],\n    columns=[\"A\", \"B\"]\n)\nnp.mean(tsdframe, axis=1)\n\nTime (s)\n----------  ---\n1           1.5\n2           1.5\n3           2\n4           1.5\n5           1.5\ndtype: float64, shape: (5,)\n\n\n\n\nimport pynapple as nap\nimport numpy as np\ntsdframe = nap.TsdFrame(\n    t=[1,2,3,4,5], \n    d=[[1,2],\n       [1,2],\n       [1,3],\n       [2,1],\n       [1,2]],\n    columns=[\"A\", \"B\"]\n)\nnp.diff(tsdframe, axis=1)\n\nTime (s)      0\n----------  ---\n1             1\n2             1\n3             2\n4            -1\n5             1\ndtype: int64, shape: (5, 1)",
