  {
    "objectID": "snippets/binning.html",
    "href": "snippets/binning.html",
    "title": "14  Binning (count)",
    "section": "",
    "text": "import pynapple as nap\nimport numpy as np\ndt = 0.001\ntimes = np.arange(0, 4, dt)\nrate = 40 * (1 + np.sin(2*np.pi*times)) / 2\nspikes = nap.Ts(times[np.random.rand(len(times)) &lt; rate * dt])\ncounts = spikes.count(0.1)\ncounts\n\nTime (s)\n-------------------  --\n0.082                 2\n0.182                 4\n0.28200000000000003   0\n0.382                 0\n0.482                 3\n0.5820000000000001    1\n0.682                 0\n...\n3.3819999999999997    2\n3.4819999999999998    3\n3.582                 1\n3.682                 1\n3.782                 0\n3.8819999999999997    0\n3.9819999999999998    4\ndtype: int64, shape: (40,)",
    "crumbs": [
      "Core functions",
      "<span class='chapter-number'>14</span>  <span class='chapter-title'>Binning (`count`)</span>"
