    "section": "",
    "text": "import pynapple as nap\nimport numpy as np\ndt = 0.01\ntimes = np.arange(0, 4, dt)\nrate = 40 * (1 + np.sin(2*np.pi*times)) / 2\nunits = nap.TsGroup({\n    1: nap.Ts(times[np.random.rand(len(times)) &lt; rate * dt]),\n    2: nap.Ts(times[np.random.rand(len(times)) &lt; rate*2 * dt]),\n})\nautocorrelogram = nap.compute_autocorrelogram(\n    units, binsize=0.1, windowsize=1.0, norm=False\n)\nautocorrelogram\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n1\n2\n\n\n\n\n-0.9\n16.666667\n42.980132\n\n\n-0.8\n16.111111\n35.364238\n\n\n-0.7\n12.777778\n27.218543\n\n\n-0.6\n10.694444\n17.748344\n\n\n-0.5\n11.805556\n14.172185\n\n\n-0.4\n11.944444\n18.079470\n\n\n-0.3\n15.000000\n29.337748\n\n\n-0.2\n19.444444\n41.192053\n\n\n-0.1\n22.222222\n52.715232\n\n\n0.0\n0.000000\n0.000000\n\n\n0.1\n22.083333\n52.715232\n\n\n0.2\n20.277778\n41.258278\n\n\n0.3\n13.888889\n28.807947\n\n\n0.4\n12.500000\n18.410596\n\n\n0.5\n10.833333\n14.039735\n\n\n0.6\n10.833333\n17.350993\n\n\n0.7\n12.638889\n26.887417\n\n\n0.8\n15.972222\n34.900662\n\n\n0.9\n16.805556\n42.913907",
