    "title": "20  Perievent",
    "section": "",
    "text": "import pynapple as nap\nimport numpy as np\nstimuli = nap.Ts(t=np.arange(0, 1000, 1), time_units=\"s\")\n\nbaseline = np.random.uniform(0, 1000, 500)\nburst = np.concatenate([\n        np.random.normal(\n            st + 0.1, 0.05, 3\n        ) \n        for st in stimuli.times()\n    ])\nts = nap.Ts(t=np.sort(np.concatenate([baseline, burst])))\nts\n\nTime (s)\n0.08523415674248622\n0.14164606655395304\n0.15238348781207722\n1.0246865979789603\n1.0728664266703758\n1.0744352279806042\n1.607068738658235\n...\n998.0419174697408\n998.0549143383058\n998.17210900468\n999.0081811278299\n999.0978970661826\n999.1157571264887\n999.1998066179041\nshape: 3500",
