  {
    "objectID": "snippets/pynaviz.html",
    "href": "snippets/pynaviz.html",
    "title": "22  Pynaviz",
    "section": "",
    "text": "Pynaviz provides interactive, high-performance visualisations designed to work seamlessly with Pynapple time series and video data.\nIt allows synchronised exploration of neural signals and behavioral recordings.\nIt is build on top of pygfx, a modern GPU-based rendering engine.\nTo install it:\npip install pynaviz[qt]",
    "crumbs": [
      "Integration with other packages",
      "<span class='chapter-number'>22</span>  <span class='chapter-title'>Pynaviz</span>"
    ]
  },
  {
    "objectID": "snippets/nemos.html",
    "href": "snippets/nemos.html",
    "title": "23  NeMoS",
    "section": "",
    "text": "NeMoS (Neural ModelS) is a statistical modeling framework optimized for systems neuroscience and powered by JAX.\nIt streamlines the process of defining and selecting models, through a collection of easy-to-use methods for feature design.\nThe core of nemos includes GPU-accelerated, well-tested implementations of standard statistical models, currently focusing on the Generalized Linear Model (GLM).\nCheck out this page for many examples of neural modelling using nemos and pynapple.\nTo install it:\npip install nemos",
    "crumbs": [
      "Integration with other packages",
      "<span class='chapter-number'>23</span>  <span class='chapter-title'>NeMoS</span>"
    ]
  },
  {
    "objectID": "snippets/spikeinterface.html",
    "href": "snippets/spikeinterface.html",
    "title": "24  SpikeInterface",
    "section": "",
    "text": "SpikeInterface is a Python library for spike sorting and electrophysiological data analysis.\nSpikeInterface can export the output of spike sorting to pynapple, allowing you to seamlessly integrate spike sorting results into your pynapple-based analysis pipeline:\nimport spikeinterface as si\nfrom spikeinterface.exporters import to_pynapple_tsgroup\n\nanalyzer = si.load_sorting_analyzer(\"path/to/analyzer\")\ntsgroup = to_pynapple_tsgroup(\n    sorting_analyzer=analyzer,\n    attach_unit_metadata=True,\n)",
    "crumbs": [
      "Integration with other packages",
      "<span class='chapter-number'>24</span>  <span class='chapter-title'>SpikeInterface</span>"
    ]
  },
  {
    "objectID": "snippets/loading.html",
    "href": "snippets/loading.html",
